  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Online Studies Scholarship 2025 Intake (Samoa)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Online Study Scholarships offer Samoan professionals the opportunity to undertake part time online postgraduate studies at an Australian Tertiary Institution thus facilitating skill development while retaining the student in country which appeals to candidates with family and work responsibilities. Consistent with the goals and objectives of the Australia Awards, the goals of the AOSS is to Develop Capacity and leadership skills so that individuals can contribute to Samoa&apos;s development and build people-to-people linkages at the individual, institutional and country levels. Annually up to 10 scholarships are offered to successful candidates.</narrative>
  </description>
